WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.575
The trees in the Wild Wood looked twisted.

2
00:00:05.576 --> 00:00:09.257
Mole followed a trail between the trees.

3
00:00:09.258 --> 00:00:11.666
The branches were leafless.

4
00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:16.680
Logs tripped him.

5
00:00:16.681 --> 00:00:21.913
Twigs cracked under his feet.

6
00:00:21.914 --> 00:00:27.099
"It's very gloomy and dark," said Mole.

7
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:32.957
From holes in trees, evil faces peeked out.

8
00:00:32.958 --> 00:00:37.413
Everywhere he looked, they stared!

9
00:00:37.414 --> 00:00:42.677
"I must get off this path," said Mole.

10
00:00:42.678 --> 00:00:47.935
Mole stepped off the trail, deep into the woods.

11
00:00:47.936 --> 00:00:51.064
He heard a faint whistling.

12
00:00:51.065 --> 00:00:53.489
"I should turn around," he said.

13
00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:56.441
"There's something up ahead."

14
00:00:56.442 --> 00:01:00.270
Then the whistling was behind him.

15
00:01:00.271 --> 00:01:05.418
"I don't think I'll turn around now," he said.

16
00:01:05.419 --> 00:01:09.894
Mole stood there, cold and afraid.

17
00:01:09.895 --> 00:01:14.569
"I'm so alone," cried Mole.

18
00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:18.845
Something made a pitter-patter sound.

19
00:01:18.846 --> 00:01:25.631
"It sounds like falling leaves," Mole said.

20
00:01:25.632 --> 00:01:29.259
"No, it sounds like little feet.

21
00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:33.276
Are they in front or behind?"

22
00:01:33.277 --> 00:01:37.245
The little feet were all around.

23
00:01:37.246 --> 00:01:41.276
The footsteps grew louder—closer!

24
00:01:41.277 --> 00:01:45.649
Suddenly a rabbit came running by.

25
00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:51.239
He almost knocked Mole down.

26
00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:53.788
The rabbit didn't look back.

27
00:01:53.789 --> 00:01:56.782
He called back,

28
00:01:56.783 --> 00:02:01.561
"Get out of here, you fool! Get out!"

29
00:02:01.562 --> 00:02:06.578
"Oh no!" cried Mole. "Oh no!"

30
00:02:06.579 --> 00:02:11.486
With his heart pounding, Mole ran.

31
00:02:11.487 --> 00:02:13.553
He tripped over roots.

32
00:02:13.554 --> 00:02:16.361
He slipped on leaves.

33
00:02:16.362 --> 00:02:21.421
Eventually he bumped into a hollow tree.

34
00:02:21.422 --> 00:02:25.332
Mole was too tired to run anymore.

35
00:02:25.333 --> 00:02:32.317
He crawled inside the hollow tree and hid.

